<title>USA: Union Bankshares Corp Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Union Bankshares Corp Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>BOWLING GREEN, Va. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bankshares Corporation</p>
<p>Key Financial Data:</p>
<p>				For the Quarter Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					 1996			   1995</p>
<p> Assets		$540.9 million	     $505.4 million</p>
<p> Deposits		 439.6 million		 415.8 million</p>
<p> Loans		    352.3 million		 327.1 million</p>
<p> Net Income		 1.7 million		  1.7 million</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share  .47 per share		.49 per share</p>
<p>				   For the Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					  1996			  1995</p>
<p> Net Income	     $7.5 million		$6.8 million</p>
<p>Net Income Per Share</p>
<p>			    2.09 per share	     1.91 per share</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
